  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening of WASH committees on their roles and responsibilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Sanitation and Hygiene is a key component of CAFOD&apos;s programme intervention under the Emergency Preparedness Response and Recovery. Capacity strengthening of partners and communities is critical to the successful implementation of  this component. this project seeks to enhance the knowledge and skills of  60 community WASH Committees (pump mechanics and pump care takers) on the national WASH standards, Operation, Maintenance and  hygiene promotion for the  sustainability of  community WASH facilities .</narrative>
  </description>
